e6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T01:52:21-07:00","id":1411179,"title":"","content":"Wow! That is great! Thank you, Tikor!<br /> <br /> Would you know if anyone make a spread sheet version of it or something similar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-05T05:05:38-07:00","id":1412055,"title":"","content":"The Census is incomplete to a degree at least, as i'm pretty sure there's at least one other canon Akuma beside Dukantha.<br /> Also, what is said on Dukantha itself (&quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">It must be noted that under 2nd Edition Dukantha has been downgraded to an Akuma</span></span>&quot; uh, what?) is kind of questionable anyway...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 09-05-2020, 08:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-06T11:38:25-07:00","id":1412316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1411138-is-there-a-list-of-all-published-solar-exalted?p=1412055#post1412055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Census is incomplete to a degree at least, as i'm pretty sure there's at least one other canon Akuma beside Dukantha.<br /> Also, what is said on Dukantha itself (&quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">It must be noted that under 2nd Edition Dukantha has been downgraded to an Akuma</span></span>&quot; uh, what?) is kind of questionable anyway...</div> </div> </div> </div>Certainly, there's the Blood Queen, off the top of my head.<br /> <br /> Dukantha is an interesting case.<br /> <br /> Blood and Salt lists him as an Infernal Exalt. His origin story says he was a Lithna god-blooded &quot;mortal&quot; Exalted by Kimbery. He's also (in 1E) responsible for telling the Deathlords how to turn Solar Exaltations into Abysals and for taking the fifty Solar Exaltations to the Yozi. Blood and Salt also says that his Exaltation is based on a Water Aspected Dragon-Blooded, but that he is no longer Water Aspected. Blood and Salt does not call him &quot;Akuma&quot;, just Infernal Exalted. He's also, supposedly, strong enough to take on Deathlords mano-e-mano and he hears the prayers of his, many, many worshipers.<br /> <br /> 2E he's a Water Aspected Dragon-Blooded Akuma.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T07:29:21-07:00","id":1413371,"title":"","content":"Yeah. In 1E Dukantha is a unique monster (by Neph) who predated both the official Akuma rules and definitely Infernals. He's a former DB with access to Solar Circle sorcery. He's probably something like a (very powerful) 2nd or third circle demon, in terms of hierarchy and (maybe) Summoning. (This is a 1E thing that happens sometimes, such as Vorlin-Dervin, the Slayer of Armies is a behemoth who is treated as a demon for Summoning purposes as a result of the treaty with the Yozi at the end if the War). <br /> <br /> To the best of my knowledge the Census is correct for 1E, spotty for 2E, and has none of the new 3E characters. But in terms of great ideas, the Unofficial Exalted Wiki has tons of great flavor stuff, so long as you remember that most of it was based on 1E, both pre and post power combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26421-scrollreader","user":"Scrollreader","date":". 09-13-2020, 11:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26421-scrollreader","name":"Scrollreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26421_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T08:22:39-07:00","id":1413376,"title":"","content":"It has a couple of 3rd edition characters but they're in the wrong places, I updated it to add my friend's PCs from Tales from the Visiting Flare before they were sub-divided into 1st, 2nd and 3rd edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}